# File storage

Survey imports, exports, and attachments are stored on local disk. Do not add a separate object-storage service unless there is an explicit product decision.

## Abstraction

Reuse or extend a single storage service:

```text
upload · download · delete · exists · getSignedUrl
```

Metadata in PostgreSQL; binary objects under `STORAGE_DIR` (default `uploads/`). Never store large image binaries in Postgres.

Signed download URLs are HMAC links served by `GET /api/v1/files`. Do not expose the uploads directory publicly.

## Uploads

Validate MIME, size limits, and filenames. Never trust client-provided names or content types.
